{
  "label": "Bulk Operations",
  "category": "Alert Acquirer",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Bulk Operations",
      "id": "bulk-operations",
      "intro": "Fitur Bulk Operations memungkinkan analyst melakukan operasi massal pada multiple alerts sekaligus untuk efisiensi kerja. Support Classification, Assign, Reassign, Lock, dan Unlock.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Bulk Classification",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik **Bulk Classification** di toolbar\n• Mode bulk aktif - hanya tampilkan alert yang:\n  - Belum ter-lock\n  - Belum ter-classify\n• Centang checkbox alert yang ingin di-classify\n• Klik **Classify Selected (N)**\n• Isi form:\n  - Request Name\n  - Description\n  - Target Classification (NEGATIVE/SUSPICIOUS/POSITIVE)\n• Submit → Akan create bulk request untuk approval\n• View history di Bulk History",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.05),0 10px 30px rgba(59,130,246,.12);border:1px solid #bfdbfe;\"><div style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3b82f6 0%,#2563eb 50%,#1d4ed8 100%);padding:18px 20px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:radial-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.15) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:18px 18px;\"></div><div style=\"position:relative;z-index:1;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;\"><div style=\"width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.18);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"><path d=\"M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m-6 9l2 2 4-4\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;letter-spacing:-.01em;\">Bulk Classification</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.75);margin-top:2px;\">Mass Alert Classification</div></div><div style=\"margin-left:auto;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:20px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.2);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.35);font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">📋 Bulk</span></div></div></div><div style=\"background:#fff;padding:14px 16px;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:10px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#64748b;font-weight:600;\">5 alerts selected</span><button style=\"padding:6px 16px;border-radius:7px;background:#3b82f6;border:none;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;cursor:pointer;\">Classify Selected (5)</button></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;\">✓ NEGATIVE</span><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fde68a;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#f59e0b;\">⚠️ SUSPICIOUS</span><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fecaca;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#dc2626;\">✗ POSITIVE</span></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Bulk Assign",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik **Bulk Assign** di toolbar\n• Filter otomatis alert yang:\n  - Belum di-assign\n  - Belum ter-classify\n  - Belum ter-lock\n• Centang checkbox alert yang ingin di-assign\n• Klik **Assign Selected (N)**\n• Pilih analyst dari dropdown\n• Submit → Alert langsung ter-assign\n• Notification sukses/gagal per alert\n• Partial success handling (beberapa sukses, beberapa gagal)",
          "color": "#f59e0b",
          "bg": "#fffbeb",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #fde68a;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #fffbeb;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f59e0b,#d97706);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 00-4-4H5a4 4 0 00-4 4v2M8.5 11a4 4 0 100-8 4 4 0 000 8zM20 8v6M23 11h-6\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Bulk Assign</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4px;\">Assign To</div><select style=\"width:100%;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;\"><option>John Analyst</option><option>Maria Supervisor</option><option>David Senior</option></select></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#64748b;font-weight:600;\">3 alerts selected</span><button style=\"padding:6px 16px;border-radius:7px;background:#f59e0b;border:none;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;cursor:pointer;\">Assign (3)</button></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Bulk Reassign",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik **Bulk Reassign** di toolbar\n• System fetch alerts yang:\n  - Sudah ter-assign ke user login\n  - Bisa di-reassign\n• Centang checkbox alert untuk reassign\n• Klik **Reassign Selected (N)**\n• Form reassign:\n  - New Assignee (analyst baru)\n  - Reason (alasan reassign)\n• Submit → Alert pindah ke analyst baru\n• Notification & partial success handling\n• Track reassignment history",
          "color": "#6366f1",
          "bg": "#eef2ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #eef2ff;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#6366f1,#4f46e5);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M17 21v-2a4 4 0 00-4-4H5a4 4 0 00-4 4v2M23 21v-2a4 4 0 00-3-3.87M16 3.13a4 4 0 010 7.75M9 11a4 4 0 100-8 4 4 0 000 8z\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Bulk Reassign</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4px;\">New Assignee</div><select style=\"width:100%;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px;\"><option>Transfer to John Analyst</option></select></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4px;\">Reason</div><textarea style=\"width:100%;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:9px;resize:none;\" rows=\"2\" placeholder=\"Why reassign these alerts?\"></textarea></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#64748b;font-weight:600;\">4 alerts selected</span><button style=\"padding:6px 16px;border-radius:7px;background:#6366f1;border:none;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;cursor:pointer;\">Reassign (4)</button></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 4,
          "title": "Bulk History",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik **Bulk History** di toolbar\n• Drawer muncul dari kanan\n• List semua bulk classification requests:\n  - Request ID & Name\n  - Author & Created Date\n  - Status (Pending/Approved/Rejected)\n  - Alert count\n• Klik request untuk view detail:\n  - List alerts dalam request\n  - Approval status\n  - Timeline\n• Dapat close view dan kembali ke normal list",
          "color": "#8b5cf6",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd6fe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #f5f3ff;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8b5cf6,#7c3aed);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Bulk Request History</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:flex;flex-col;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fffbeb,#fef3c7);border:1px solid #fde68a;\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:start;margin-bottom:6px;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">REQ-2024-001</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;\">Fraud Alert Classification</div></div><span style=\"padding:3px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fcd34d;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#f59e0b;\">⏳ PENDING</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;\">By: John Analyst</span><span style=\"padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#eef2ff;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#6366f1;\">15 alerts</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f0fdf4,#dcfce7);border:1px solid #bbf7d0;\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:start;margin-bottom:6px;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">REQ-2024-002</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;\">Suspicious Transactions</div></div><span style=\"padding:3px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #86efac;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;\">✓ APPROVED</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;\">By: Maria Supervisor</span><span style=\"padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#eef2ff;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#6366f1;\">8 alerts</span></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 5,
          "title": "Cancel & Reset Bulk Mode",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Setiap bulk mode memiliki tombol **Cancel**\n• Klik Cancel untuk:\n  - Exit bulk mode\n  - Clear selection\n  - Kembali ke normal view\n  - Restore semua filters\n• Bisa switch antar bulk modes\n• Alert yang sudah dalam bulk request:\n  - Ditandai dengan border dashed hijau\n  - Background pattern stripe\n  - Tidak bisa dipilih lagi sampai request complete",
          "color": "#14b8a6",
          "bg": "#f0fdfa",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #99f6e4;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0fdfa;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#f0fdfa,#fff);\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Bulk Mode Active</span><div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;\"><button style=\"padding:6px 14px;border-radius:7px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#475569;cursor:pointer;\">Cancel</button><button style=\"padding:6px 14px;border-radius:7px;background:#14b8a6;border:none;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;cursor:pointer;\">Submit (3)</button></div></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;\"><div style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;border:2px dashed #86efac;position:relative;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background:repeating-linear-gradient(-45deg,rgba(34,197,94,0.03) 0px,rgba(34,197,94,0.03) 6px,transparent 6px,transparent 14px);\"></div><div style=\"position:relative;z-index:1;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;margin-bottom:4px;\">ALT-2024-001234</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;\">Already in bulk request</div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
